sequenceDiagram
    autonumber
    participant HTML as app.html
    participant Main as main.js
    participant PWA as pwa.js
    participant Boot as appBootstrap.js
    participant FB as firebaseApp.js
    participant FS as Firestore
    participant UI as finish() init*

    HTML->>Main: type=module load
    Main->>Boot: startApp()

    par 버전 확인 (최대 8초)
        Boot->>PWA: ensureLatestVersion()
        PWA->>PWA: fetch version.json
        alt 버전 불일치
            PWA->>PWA: SW skipWaiting + reload
        end
    and 타임아웃 폴백
        Boot->>Boot: setTimeout(bootOnce, 8000)
    end

    Boot->>Boot: bootApp()
    Boot->>Boot: initAppCore()
    Boot->>Boot: wireScrollBridge()
    Boot->>FB: initFirebase(hooks)

    FB->>FS: onSnapshot members (orderBy name)
    FB->>FS: onSnapshot challenges (orderBy createdAt desc)
    FB->>FS: onSnapshot seasons (orderBy startDate desc)
    FB->>FS: onSnapshot tournaments

    FS-->>FB: 첫 스냅샷 (각 컬렉션)
    FB->>FB: requestAnimationFrame 디바운스
    FB->>Boot: hooks.onReady() → finish()

    Boot->>UI: initMatchStats, initModals, initAppNav...
    Boot->>UI: initChallenges, initMembersTab, initMyPage...
    Boot->>UI: initWizard, initPwa, initMemberPhotos
    Boot->>UI: applyEntryNavigation()
    Boot->>UI: #ls 숨김, #app 표시

    Note over FS,UI: 이후 스냅샷 변경 시 hooks.onMembers/onChallenges/onSeasons 호출
